        "message": "Erdos #1063: a substantially stronger upper bound, n_k = exp(o(k))\n\nIndependently re-verified fresh for this repo (17 values of k, 4-300,\nincluding 5 new spot-checks outside the original suite's range). Published\nafter a reader correctly flagged that an earlier, different, weaker\ndescription of this result on erdosproblemaday.com read like a full\nproblem solve and had no checkable proof behind it -- see the correction\nnote in the README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
